00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:13,938
Writing, task one. Form number 12. You want to book a table at a restaurant using an online form. Answer the questions in a full sentence, at least ten words.

2
00:00:14,633 --> 00:00:17,177
When and for how many people do you want to book?

3
00:00:27,567 --> 00:00:31,272
I'd like a booking for Saturday the twentieth at seven in the evening for six people.

4
00:00:32,167 --> 00:00:33,446
Why are you coming to us?

5
00:00:43,833 --> 00:00:49,031
We're coming because we're celebrating my wife's birthday and your restaurant has good reviews.

6
00:00:49,933 --> 00:00:51,977
Do you have any special requests?

7
00:01:02,367 --> 00:01:07,273
Please give us a table by the window and one high chair, because we have a small child.

8
00:01:08,167 --> 00:01:17,713
Fill in form 12 on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website. The link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
